  "body": "Closes #2174. Closes #3806.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nThank you for contributing to the HTML Standard! Please describe the change you are making and complete the checklist below if your change is not editorial.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\r\n   * Chrome does nothing with this argument ([code](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/master:third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/history.cc;l=267;drc=299704ab18e08470c83723b21dfce828061059af))\r\n   * Firefox does nothing with this argument ([code](https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/f6ffb71dca9eb491e85aa95042380b2602008b00/docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp#11315))\r\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\r\n   * Not really testable as it only ever was intended to affect UI\r\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\r\n   * Chrome: N/A\r\n   * Firefox: N/A\r\n   * Safari: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=223190\r\n\r\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\r\n\r\n/cc @beidson. Note that this doesn't make Safari non-conforming, because browser UI like the back button dropdown is not governed by specs. But Safari might still want to align with the other browsers, if they find the arguments in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2174#issuecomment-403521462 at all persuasive.\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\r\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\r\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\r\n\r\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\r\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\r\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\r\n    and remove what's below.\r\n-->\r\n***\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6482/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 15, 2021, 4:47 PM UTC (8b854eb)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6482/2062a68...8b854eb/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 15, 2021, 4:47 PM UTC (8b854eb)\">diff</a> )\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6482/history.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 15, 2021, 4:47 PM UTC (8b854eb)\">/history.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6482/2062a68...8b854eb/history.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 15, 2021, 4:47 PM UTC (8b854eb)\">diff</a> )",
